[
  {
    "RowId": 42609,
    "Text": "Ah, you've come. I'll begin by wearing you down."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42610,
    "Text": "I've created new Endless for you. Not all are warriors, but they will follow orders."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42611,
    "Text": "“Kill” and “survive” and so forth. Here, I shall prepare the stage for battle."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42612,
    "Text": "The memories of a physician. One who saves lives should be reluctant to die."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42613,
    "Text": "Oh, you've overburdened the system. No matter. It served its purpose."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42614,
    "Text": "Next, we visit a prison of sinister repute. I need not compel them to fight."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42615,
    "Text": "These are loyal executioners. They shall deal appropriately with “criminals.”"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42616,
    "Text": "Beginning to tire? Good. I bid you continue on."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42617,
    "Text": "Memories from an age rife with death... The desperation will serve well."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42618,
    "Text": "The enemy is at the gate. To arms, good soldiers─protect your kingdom."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42619,
    "Text": "An amalgam of memories. Let us see how it fares."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42620,
    "Text": "It is the midst of the Storm Surge."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42621,
    "Text": "Countless lives are lost in the senseless conflict."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42622,
    "Text": "The war swells in scope and intensity."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42623,
    "Text": "The bombs rain down without pause or mercy."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42624,
    "Text": "The spark of life is dimmed with every blinding flash."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42625,
    "Text": "Death is everywhere, pillaging the promise of the future."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42626,
    "Text": "Your sentence is death. How long can you defy it?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 42627,
    "Text": "Criminals may run, but they cannot escape."
  },
  {
