  {
    "RowId": 43000,
    "Text": "Shining sacks collected"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43100,
    "Text": "Traverse Quan Caverns"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43101,
    "Text": "Defeat the Treno catoblepas"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43102,
    "Text": "Traverse the Treno lowlands"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43103,
    "Text": "Defeat Amdusias"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43104,
    "Text": "Traverse the streets of Treno"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43105,
    "Text": "Defeat the thundergust griffin"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43106,
    "Text": "No matter how many come, we fight hand in hand! Forevermore!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43107,
    "Text": "君たち、旅人さんか！？\nみんな街の奥へ避難してるから、そこを目指すといい！"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43300,
    "Text": "You called, my sapling?\nMay all who threaten you know my wrath!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43400,
    "Text": "We're in it now... I'm counting on you!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43401,
    "Text": "Waugh, the flatcar!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43402,
    "Text": "Turrets!? Uh...good luck!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43403,
    "Text": "Not again... You all right back there?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43404,
    "Text": "Use the transport panels to get up there!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43405,
    "Text": "How many times is it going to do that!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43406,
    "Text": "What in the─ You're still on board, right!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43407,
    "Text": "Aetherial...arms...?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43408,
    "Text": "I have to disconnect the car. Quick, jump on the next one!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43409,
    "Text": "Thunderous heavens!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43410,
    "Text": "Stop doing that!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43411,
    "Text": "Look out!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43412,
    "Text": "We're running out of train!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43413,
    "Text": "Pretty sure this is bad!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43414,
    "Text": "Hit it harder!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43500,
    "Text": "Defeat Vamp Fatale"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43501,
    "Text": "Hahaha... Will you cry out in pleasure, or pain?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43502,
    "Text": "Feast your eyes on the lovely─and lethal─Vamp Fatale!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43503,
    "Text": "Will the challenger fall prey to the cruel mistress?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43504,
    "Text": "Come, my pets!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43505,
    "Text": "This is my show. I will hear you scream."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43506,
    "Text": "A wicked weapon! Vamp Fatale's poised to execute a fatality!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43507,
    "Text": "You will become a stain on this ring."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43508,
    "Text": "The challenger has nowhere left to run!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43509,
    "Text": "This is just the beginning. My faithful minions─give me your aether!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43510,
    "Text": "It's begun! She's draining the audience─of their aether!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43511,
    "Text": "All of you will feed me."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43512,
    "Text": "Vamp Fatale's unleashed the aether! The challenger's in her realm now!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43513,
    "Text": "You are a stubborn one. But it is not too late to beg for mercy!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43514,
    "Text": "The spectacle of slaughter resumes! How will the challenger adapt?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43515,
    "Text": "It's a veritable rain of death!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43516,
    "Text": "Such insolence I have never known! More─I need more aether!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43517,
    "Text": "She's draining the crowd's aether again! I hope our dear spectators are feeling alright..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43518,
    "Text": "In pain lies pleasure!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43519,
    "Text": "She's unleashed even more aether! How will this end!?"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43520,
    "Text": "You'll not escape me!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43521,
    "Text": "It's still not enough. I will take everything you have!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43522,
    "Text": "The seductress is at it again! I...I'm feeling a little lightheaded..."
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43523,
    "Text": "No mercy!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43524,
    "Text": "She's siphoned the challenger's aether!"
  },
  {
    "RowId": 43525,
    "Text": "On your knees, damn you!"
  },
